5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand why some of our recent initiatives have struggled to sustain themselves. I will look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I wish to understand the actual impact of our previous efforts. I will examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I will review the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. I prefer to know exactly what we can afford before we start dreaming.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I want to make sure our dear hospital can comfortably handle whatever we add. I shall look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
